# 🛍️ NestJS Product API

This is a **RESTful Product API** built with [NestJS](https://nestjs.com/), **MongoDB**, and **Multer** for image uploads. It supports:

- 📝 Product creation
- 🖼️ Single and multiple image uploads
- 🔎 Filtering by name, stock, and creation date
- 🔒 JWT-based route protection
- ✅ Object-Oriented Architecture

## 🚀 Features

### ✅ Product Endpoints
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| `POST` | `/products/upload-single` | Create product with one image |
| `POST` | `/products/upload-multiple` | Create product with multiple images |
| `GET`  | `/products` | Get all products |
| `GET`  | `/products/:id` | Get single product |
| `GET`  | `/products/filter` | Filter products |
| `DELETE` | `/products/:id` | Delete product |

### 🔐 Protected by JWT
All routes are secured using `JwtAuthGuard`.

---

## 🛠️ Installation

git clone https://github.com/yourusername/nestjs-product-api.git
cd nestjs-product-api
npm install
⚙️ Environment Setup
Create a .env file:

env

MONGO_URI=mongodb://localhost:27017/products-db
JWT_SECRET=your_jwt_secret
PORT=3000

# development
npm run start:dev

# production
npm run start:prod
📤 Image Uploads
Uploaded images are stored in the uploads/ directory.

You can serve them statically by enabling:
app.useStaticAssets(join(__dirname, '..', 'uploads'));

✨ Filtering Example
GET /products/filter?name=shirt&createdFrom=2024-01-01&createdTo=2024-12-31&inStock=true

📦 Tech Stack
NestJS (MVC + Modules)
Mongoose (MongoDB ODM)
Multer (File Uploads)
TypeScript
JWT Authentication

🧪 Testing (Optional)
# run unit tests
npm run test
